2	// is a pure function (name in, {subject, html, text} out) so the templating and
3	// HTML-escaping are unit-testable without any network, and sendWaitlistConfirmation
4	// is the thin, env-gated transport. fetch is available in the default Convex
5	// runtime, so this file needs no "use node".
